ow unresolved'\\\\''),(True,'\\\\''now a forecast'\\\\''),(False,'\\\\''still unresolved'\\\\'')]\nactual=[changed(unavailable,0,a0),changed(old,0,a1),changed(unavailable,0,a1)]\nassert actual==expected,actual\nprint('\\\\''availability transitions'\\\\'',actual)\n'\"","aggregated_output":"component drop with unchanged outcome: (True, \"source figures added [], dropped ['e2499|$108.0 billion, plus or minus 2%|relative']\")\navailability transitions [(True, 'now unresolved'), (True, 'now a forecast'), (False, 'still unresolved')]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
